{"seq":1,"slug":"infra-test-in-pipeline","title":"CI/CD 中的基础设施测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/operations/infra-test-in-pipeline","wordCount":1120,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-cd-中的基础设施测试\">CI/CD 中的基础设施测试</h1><p>基础设施测试的价值只有在自动化运行时才能持续兑现。手动运行测试不可扩展，也无法保证每次变更都经过验证。将测试嵌入 CI/CD 管道是从&quot;偶尔测试&quot;到&quot;持续验证&quot;的关键转变——每次 Pull Request 都必须通过测试门禁才能合并，每次部署都附带自动化的信心保障。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>测试编排</strong>：将静态分析、单元测试、策略检查、集成测试按依赖关系串联为管道</li>\n<li><strong>阶梯门禁</strong>：不同阶段对应不同失败行为（阻断 PR / 阻断合并 / 阻断部署）</li>\n<li><strong>Plan 输出复用</strong>：plan JSON 作为策略检查、成本估算、变更分析的共享输入</li>\n<li><strong>矩阵化执行</strong>：多 workspace 并行 plan/test 缩短管道总时间</li>\n<li><strong>多环境策略</strong>：dev/staging/production 各有不同的测试深度与部署方式</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"管道中的测试编排模型\">管道中的测试编排模型</h2><p>基础设施 CI/CD 管道的典型阶段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[代码提交] --&gt; B[静态分析]&#10;    B --&gt; C[单元测试]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Plan 生成]&#10;    D --&gt; E[策略检查]&#10;    E --&gt; F[集成测试]&#10;    F --&gt; G[安全扫描]&#10;    G --&gt; H[人工审批]&#10;    H --&gt; I[Apply 部署]&#10;    I --&gt; J[Smoke 测试]&#10;    J --&gt; K[漂移监控]\">graph LR\n    A[代码提交] --&gt; B[静态分析]\n    B --&gt; C[单元测试]\n    C --&gt; D[Plan 生成]\n    D --&gt; E[策略检查]\n    E --&gt; F[集成测试]\n    F --&gt; G[安全扫描]\n    G --&gt; H[人工审批]\n    H --&gt; I[Apply 部署]\n    I --&gt; J[Smoke 测试]\n    J --&gt; K[漂移监控]</pre><p>每个阶段的执行约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>超时</th>\n<th>失败行为</th>\n<th>并行度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态分析</td>\n<td>每次 push</td>\n<td>2 min</td>\n<td>阻断 PR</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>每次 push</td>\n<td>5 min</td>\n<td>阻断 PR</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plan 生成</td>\n<td>PR 创建/更新</td>\n<td>5 min</td>\n<td>阻断合并</td>\n<td>按 workspace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略检查</td>\n<td>Plan 生成后</td>\n<td>1 min</td>\n<td>阻断合并</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>PR 标记 ready</td>\n<td>20 min</td>\n<td>阻断合并</td>\n<td>受限（2-4）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全扫描</td>\n<td>合并到 main</td>\n<td>10 min</td>\n<td>阻断部署</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apply</td>\n<td>人工批准后</td>\n<td>30 min</td>\n<td>回滚</td>\n<td>串行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Smoke 测试</td>\n<td>Apply 成功后</td>\n<td>5 min</td>\n<td>告警 + 可能回滚</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"github-actions-实现\">GitHub Actions 实现</h2><p>一个完整的基础设施测试管道示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Infrastructure Tests&#10;on:&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    paths: [&#39;infrastructure/**&#39;]&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  static-analysis:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - name: Terraform Format&#10;        run: tofu fmt -check -recursive&#10;      - name: Terraform Validate&#10;        run: tofu validate&#10;      - name: TFLint&#10;        run: tflint --recursive&#10;      - name: Checkov Security Scan&#10;        run: checkov -d . --framework terraform --soft-fail-on LOW&#10;&#10;  unit-tests:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    needs: static-analysis&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - name: OpenTofu Unit Tests&#10;        run: tofu test -test-directory=tests/unit&#10;&#10;  plan:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    needs: unit-tests&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix:&#10;        workspace: [networking, compute, database]&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - name: Terraform Plan&#10;        run: |&#10;          tofu init&#10;          tofu plan -out=tfplan&#10;          tofu show -json tfplan &gt; plan.json&#10;      - name: Policy Check&#10;        run: conftest test plan.json --policy ./policies/&#10;&#10;  integration:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    needs: plan&#10;    if: github.event.pull_request.draft == false&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-go@v5&#10;        with:&#10;          go-version: &#39;1.22&#39;&#10;      - name: Run Integration Tests&#10;        run: go test ./tests/integration/ -v -timeout 30m&#10;        env:&#10;          AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID: ${{ secrets.TEST_AWS_KEY }}&#10;          AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY: ${{ secrets.TEST_AWS_SECRET }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Infrastructure Tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'infrastructure/**'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  static-analysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Terraform Format</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tofu fmt -check -recursive</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Terraform Validate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tofu validate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">TFLint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tflint --recursive</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Checkov Security Scan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">checkov -d . --framework terraform --soft-fail-on LOW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  unit-tests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    needs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">static-analysis</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">OpenTofu Unit Tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tofu test -test-directory=tests/unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  plan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    needs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">unit-tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      matrix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        workspace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">compute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Terraform Plan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          tofu init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          tofu plan -out=tfplan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          tofu show -json tfplan > plan.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Policy Check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">conftest test plan.json --policy ./policies/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  integration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    needs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">plan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">github.event.pull_request.draft == false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-go@v5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          go-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1.22'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run Integration Tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">go test ./tests/integration/ -v -timeout 30m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.TEST_AWS_KEY }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.TEST_AWS_SECRET }}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"测试阶段的依赖与并行优化\">测试阶段的依赖与并行优化</h2><p>测试阶段之间存在依赖关系，但在同一阶段内应尽可能并行：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{pipeline} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\max(T_{stage_i\\_jobs})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即管道总时间等于各阶段中<em>最慢任务</em>的时间之和。优化策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>静态分析并行化</strong>：tflint、checkov、<code>tofu fmt</code> 同时运行</li>\n<li><strong>Plan 矩阵化</strong>：多个 workspace 的 plan 并行生成</li>\n<li><strong>集成测试分片</strong>：按模块组拆分为多个 job</li>\n<li><strong>缓存利用</strong>：Provider 插件、Go 模块、测试状态的缓存</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"plan-输出作为测试制品\">Plan 输出作为测试制品</h2><p><code>terraform plan</code> 的 JSON 输出是多个下游测试的输入源：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[tofu plan -out=tfplan] --&gt; B[tofu show -json tfplan]&#10;    B --&gt; C[plan.json]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Conftest 策略检查]&#10;    C --&gt; E[成本估算 Infracost]&#10;    C --&gt; F[变更影响分析]&#10;    C --&gt; G[PR 评论自动生成]\">graph TD\n    A[tofu plan -out=tfplan] --&gt; B[tofu show -json tfplan]\n    B --&gt; C[plan.json]\n    C --&gt; D[Conftest 策略检查]\n    C --&gt; E[成本估算 Infracost]\n    C --&gt; F[变更影响分析]\n    C --&gt; G[PR 评论自动生成]</pre><p>Plan JSON 中的关键字段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>resource_changes[].change.actions</code></td>\n<td>识别创建/更新/删除操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>resource_changes[].change.after</code></td>\n<td>策略规则评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>resource_changes[].change.before</code></td>\n<td>漂移检测对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>output_changes</code></td>\n<td>输出值变更追踪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"测试结果的可观测性\">测试结果的可观测性</h2><p>测试不只是 pass/fail——测试结果本身需要可观测性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>告警阈值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>测试执行时间趋势</td>\n<td>管道性能退化早期预警</td>\n<td>P95 &gt; 历史 2 倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试失败率</td>\n<td>代码质量信号</td>\n<td>连续 3 次失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试资源创建时间</td>\n<td>云 API 性能退化</td>\n<td>&gt; 历史均值 50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试覆盖率变化</td>\n<td>新代码是否带测试</td>\n<td>覆盖率下降 &gt; 5%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多环境部署的测试策略\">多环境部署的测试策略</h2><p>典型的多环境管道：dev → staging → production，每个环境的测试深度不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环境</th>\n<th>测试范围</th>\n<th>部署方式</th>\n<th>回滚策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Dev</td>\n<td>静态 + 单元 + 快速集成</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>重新部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Staging</td>\n<td>全量集成 + 安全扫描 + 性能</td>\n<td>自动（main 合并后）</td>\n<td>自动回滚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Production</td>\n<td>Smoke + 金丝雀验证</td>\n<td>手动批准</td>\n<td>蓝绿切换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"失败处理与自动恢复\">失败处理与自动恢复</h2><p>管道中测试失败的处理不应只是&quot;标红阻断&quot;——需要区分不同类型的失败：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>确定性失败</strong>（策略违规、lint 错误）：立即阻断，开发者必须修复</li>\n<li><strong>非确定性失败</strong>（API 超时、资源配额）：自动重试 1-2 次</li>\n<li><strong>环境问题</strong>（测试账户配额耗尽）：告警运维团队 + 暂时跳过</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 重试策略示例&#10;- name: Integration Tests&#10;  run: go test ./tests/ -v -timeout 30m -count=1&#10;  retries: 2&#10;  retry-on: timeout\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 重试策略示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Integration Tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">go test ./tests/ -v -timeout 30m -count=1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  retries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  retry-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">timeout</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关于测试中创建的资源如何避免成本泄漏，参见 <a href=\"../foundations/testing-environments-strategies\">测试环境与策略</a>。关于部署后如何持续检测配置偏移，参见 <a href=\"drift-detection-reconciliation\">漂移检测与修复</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>CI/CD 中的基础设施测试将验证从手动偶发转变为自动持续。管道设计的核心是分阶段编排——快速反馈的静态分析和单元测试在每次提交时运行，耗时的集成测试在 PR ready 时触发，安全扫描和 smoke 测试在部署前后执行。Plan JSON 作为多个下游检查的共享输入，避免重复执行。测试失败的分类处理（确定性阻断、暂态重试、环境告警）确保管道既严格又不脆弱。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CI/CD 中的基础设施测试","id":"ci-cd-中的基础设施测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"管道中的测试编排模型","id":"管道中的测试编排模型"},{"level":2,"text":"GitHub Actions 实现","id":"github-actions-实现"},{"level":2,"text":"测试阶段的依赖与并行优化","id":"测试阶段的依赖与并行优化"},{"level":2,"text":"Plan 输出作为测试制品","id":"plan-输出作为测试制品"},{"level":2,"text":"测试结果的可观测性","id":"测试结果的可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"多环境部署的测试策略","id":"多环境部署的测试策略"},{"level":2,"text":"失败处理与自动恢复","id":"失败处理与自动恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"安全合规扫描","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e/security-compliance-scanning"},"next":{"title":"漂移检测与修复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/operations/drift-detection-reconciliation"}}